{"full_name":"chriswritescode-dev/opencode-manager","path":"README.md","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T15:20:52.788Z","length":2994,"text":"OpenCode Manager \n\n \n A self-hosted command center for OpenCode . Sessions, git, terminal, and schedules in one web app, on your desktop and your phone. \n \n\n \n opencodemanager.app \n ·\n Docs \n ·\n Releases \n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n\n Quick Start\n\nRequires Docker with Compose v2.\n\n \n\nThe installer starts OpenCode Manager on and asks before sharing anything from your machine. Re-run it to update. On first launch you create an admin account.\n\nRequirements, Compose and source installs, and every feature are covered at opencodemanager.app :\n\n- Installation\n- Features\n- Configuration\n- ocm CLI\n- Troubleshooting\n\n Development\n\nThis repository is a pnpm workspace: backend/ (Bun + Hono), frontend/ (React + Vite), shared/ (schemas and types) and ocm-cli/ (the ocm CLI).\n\n \n\nSee the Development Guide for setup, scripts, database notes and testing.\n\n License\n\nMIT","intro":{"html":"<h4>OpenCode Manager</h4><p>\n    <strong>A self-hosted command center for <a href=\"https://opencode.ai\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">OpenCode</a>. Sessions, git, terminal, and schedules in one web app, on your desktop and your phone.</strong>\n</p><p>\n    <a href=\"https://opencodemanager.app\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>opencodemanager.app</strong></a>\n    ·\n    <a href=\"https://opencodemanager.app/docs\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Docs</a>\n    ·\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/chriswritescode-dev/opencode-manager/releases/latest\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Releases</a>\n</p><p>\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/chriswritescode-dev/opencode-manager/blob/main/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/chriswritescode-dev/opencode-manager?label=License\" alt=\"License\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/chriswritescode-dev/opencode-manager/stargazers\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/chriswritescode-dev/opencode-manager?label=Stars\" alt=\"Stars\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/chriswritescode-dev/opencode-manager/releases/latest\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/tag/chriswritescode-dev/opencode-manager\" alt=\"Latest Release\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/chriswritescode-dev/opencode-manager/pulls\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/PRs-welcome-brightgreen.svg\" alt=\"PRs Welcome\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n    </a>\n</p><p>\n    <a href=\"https://opencodemanager.app\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chriswritescode-dev/opencode-manager/main/.github/readme-hero.webp\" alt=\"OpenCode Manager on mobile: permission request, project switcher, source control, and schedules\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"900\" />\n    </a>\n</p><p>\n    <a href=\"https://opencodemanager.app\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chriswritescode-dev/opencode-manager/main/.github/readme-desktop.webp\" alt=\"OpenCode Manager on desktop: a session with the live Preview panel\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"900\" />\n    </a>\n</p>","truncated":true,"chars":1818},"sections":{"install":{"title":"Quick Start","html":"<p>Requires Docker with Compose v2.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">curl -fsSL https://opencodemanager.app/install | sh\n</code></pre>\n<p>The installer starts OpenCode Manager on <a href=\"http://localhost:5003\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">http://localhost:5003</a> and asks before sharing anything from your machine. Re-run it to update. On first launch you create an admin account.</p>\n<p>Requirements, Compose and source installs, and every feature are covered at <strong><a href=\"https://opencodemanager.app\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">opencodemanager.app</a></strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://opencodemanager.app/docs/getting-started/installation\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Installation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://opencodemanager.app/docs/features/overview\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Features</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://opencodemanager.app/docs/configuration/environment\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Configuration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://opencodemanager.app/docs/ocm-cli\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><code>ocm</code> CLI</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://opencodemanager.app/docs/troubleshooting\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Troubleshooting</a></li>\n</ul>","truncated":false,"chars":766},"usage":null,"features":null}}
